eIn\">genieten </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">van </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">bekende </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">titels, </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">online </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">multiplayer </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">of </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">entertainment </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">zoals </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">streamingdiensten.</span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1972\"><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Dit </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">exemplaar </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">is </span><strong><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">B-</span></strong><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\"><strong>grade</strong>, </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">wat </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">betekent </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">dat </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">de </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">console </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">goed </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">gebruikt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">is </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">maar </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">nog </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">steeds </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">perfect </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">geschikt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">voor </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">dagelijks </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">gebruik. </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">Er </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">wordt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">een </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">controller </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">meegeleverd, </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">zodat </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">je </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">meteen </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">kunt </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">beginnen </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">met </span><span class=\"BZ_Pyq_fadeIn\">spelen. </span></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"